ailure to comply or repeated violations may result in further escalation in accordance with subdivision rules and local ordinances.</p></div>\n</div>','{\"pet_name\": \"Mochi\", \"pet_type\": \"Dog\", \"issued_by\": \"Leilah (Subdivision Leader)\", \"issue_date\": \"November 18, 2026\", \"issuer_name\": \"Leilah\", \"issuer_role\": \"Subdivision Leader\", \"summons_date\": \"November 23, 2026 at 1:39 AM\", \"incident_date\": \"November 17, 2026 at 10:11 PM\", \"resident_name\": \"Emmanuel Vito Cruz\", \"summons_place\": \"Subdivision office\", \"warning_level\": \"2nd Warning\", \"case_reference\": \"SS-2026-0005\", \"required_action\": \"Pet owners are responsible for keeping their dogs and cats under control within the subdivision. Pets must not be allowed to roam freely, damage other residents\' property, create disturbances, or pose safety risks to other residents.\", \"observation_days\": \"\", \"policy_reference\": \"Selera Homes Homeowners Association (HOA) House Rules and Regulations – Pet Ownership and Control Section. — Uncontrolled roaming dog\", \"resident_address\": \"Block 2, Lot 3, 14 Dama de Noche, Brgy. Cutcut, Guiguinto, Bulacan, Central Luzon, 1100\", \"subdivision_name\": \"Selera Homes\", \"subdivision_email\": \"\", \"subdivision_phone\": \"\", \"warning_reference\": \"WARN-PENDING\", \"subdivision_address\": \"\", \"violation_description\": \"dog always scattering my trash\"}',1,'Leilah (Subdivision Leader)','2026-11-18 01:39:44',51,'sent',NULL,'2026-11-18 01:40:03','2026-11-18 01:40:03','2026-11-18 15:12:41',0,NULL,'2026-11-18 01:39:43','2026-11-18 15:12:41');
